// Load a program: find every module from the entry's `use`s in waves, parse each file (main file plus parts),
// always pull in `j3.sys`, and hand the parsed module graph to `sema`.
//
// Port of: j3c/src/compile/loader.rs (module waves; compile.rs itself is on driver.j3, plan 11 B1)
// J3: Parse files on a thread pool per wave (the Rust loader was serial). Stage functions take explicit
// inputs (plan 11 B5): `parseFile(src, file: FileId): ParsedFile` is pure (no globals, no Session writes
// besides its returned diags), so it can run in parallel and be memoized by `(file, hash of src)`.
// Resolving a module's `use`s to files is a separate step that reads only the module list and paths.
module j3c.load;
